?INCLUDE 'sE9_mansion_intro'
sE9_mansion_intro.dialogstring_08FCBE! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will comes to at the[N]entrance of a strange[N]mansion.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sEA_solid_arm'
sEA_solid_arm.dialogstring_08FA31! `[DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][SFX:10]Welcome to my mansion.[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][SFX:10]Gem the jewel merchant was[N]a temporary form. My true[N]form is called Solid Arm.[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][SFX:10]Soul Blader defeated me[N]long ago. My power was[N]sealed in Red Jewels and[N]scattered across the world.[FIN]For ages I worked to[N]gather them again.[FIN]Kings, merchants,[N]slavers.[FIN]A word whispered here.[N]A fortune offered there.[FIN]The slave trade proved[N]especially useful.[FIN]All those desperate hands[N]searching the earth for[N]treasure.[FIN]And then came you.[FIN]You did nearly as much[N]for me on this journey[N]as a century of slaves.[FIN]You even turned in an[N]escaped slave to gain[N]my reward…[FIN]Such a hero.[FIN]My core is nearly whole.[FIN]You have been extremely[N]helpful, Will.[FIN]I no longer require your[N]help.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'game_over_sequence'
game_over_sequence.dialogstring_00D7C2! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: When I came to, I[N]found that I had collapsed[N]in a familiar place. Was I[N]having a nightmare?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sEA_solid_arm'
sEA_solid_arm.dialogstring_08FBC8! `[SFX:10][DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][SFX:10]I can hear a faint voice…[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:10][DLY:4]It has been done once[N]again…[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][SFX:10][DLY:4]Soul Blader was strong[N]too, but I think you are[N]even stronger…[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][SFX:10][DLY:4]Danger is approaching this[N]planet. Well, you should[N]return to the Tower of[N]Babel and hurry on…[END]`
